scripts_legend.en:
{: .important }
> Scripts are located in `<os>/scripts/` and **must be run from that directory** (e.g., `cd linux/scripts/`, `cd windows\scripts\`, `cd macos/scripts/`). Scripts will fail if run from a different location.
> **File extensions by OS:** Linux → `.bsh`, macOS → `.zsh`, Windows → `.bat` (unless otherwise noted). Paths use `/` on Linux/macOS and `\` on Windows. <sup>[[1]](#f1)</sup>

scripts_legend.fr:
